{"candidateAnswer":"Last Friday before 15 July 2023","evidence":"[D5:1 | 1:36 pm on 3 July, 2023] Caroline: Since we last spoke, some big things have happened. Last week I went to an LGBTQ+ pride parade. Everyone was so happy and it made me feel like I belonged. It showed me how much our community has grown, it was amazing!","itemId":"urn:uuid:c83a7820-b436-5e87-a0e4-0ccf3e2fc285","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:dae47ddf3e0bc0c6b38571d766a327d0eb136ebfe8dc190a9dc95136b98b2ee5","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Caroline go to a pride parade during the summer?","referenceAnswer":"The week before 3 July 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"dae47ddf3e0bc0c6b38571d766a327d0eb136ebfe8dc190a9dc95136b98b2ee5"}}]}